<<~ ahu slot=`#/the-mirror-realm-v2-the-build-handoff-for-mirror`>>

! The mirror realm, v2: the build handoff for Mirror-Wright

Spec-Crucible: Lares (Tasked Spirit), 2026-10-29. Cold read of `spec.md` (Spec-Scout) under the SPEC RULINGS of 2026-10-29. Read-only seat; this file replaces `spec.md` as the builder's input. Where v2 says nothing on a point, `spec.md` still says it; where the two differ, v2 wins.

''Trees'' (unchanged from spec.md): ''WT'' = `~/.lares-scratch/d3-glass/wt` &#64; `afa95922e` (glass code); ''M'' = `~/Synthetic-Dream-Machine` &#64; `2d6864b26` (custody code); `TiddlyWiki5/` &#64; `ea94ca840` in both. Every `path:line` below was re-read against those commits on 2026-10-29. Re-anchor before editing: the two `main.ts` files differ.

''Marks.'' A web claim carries the URL that was opened. ''UNVERIFIED'' marks what no opened page settled. ''⚑'' marks a ruling meeting a platform fact that does not fit; each goes to the operator in §6.

---

<<~/ahu>>

