!! 4. Platform facts the slices lean on (cited once, referenced below)

* ''F1'' `bootprefix.js:29-36` detects `browser` from `window`/`document` and `node` from `typeof process === "object"`, unless pre-seeded; `:39-42` overwrites `$tw.boot.tasks`. `boot.js:862` passes `Buffer` only when `$tw.browser` is falsy; the browser module executor is `Function("return "+code)` (`boot.js:617`). `boot.js:2777` autoboots only when `!suppressBoot`.
* ''F2'' `boot.js:2579,2692,2699` honour `$tw.boot.disabledStartupModules`. `boot.js:1456-1482` assign shadows in ascending `plugin-priority`; `:1543` defines a shadow module only with `module-type` and no overriding ordinary tiddler. Core's priority: `"0"`.
* ''F3'' `widget.js:708-713,731-756`: listeners accumulate, every handler runs.
* ''F4'' `startup.js:104-122`: Syncer iff a `syncadaptor` exports `adaptorClass`; SaverHandler always. `saver-handler.js:26-27,122` `initSavers` in browser mode; `:30-91` dirty tracking off `$:/config/SaverFilter`; `:103` `tm-download-file`; `:159` AutoSave; `:201-208` `tc-dirty`. `put.js:11-13,38-40` HEAD and OPTIONS from the constructor.
* ''F5'' `boot.js:252-257` `window.onerror` under `trapErrors`; `:203-242` error forms on `document.body` when `browser && !node`; `:2524-2536` `onbeforeunload`; `:644-650,2765-2767` the PasswordPrompt div; `:785,801` `window.sjcl` → `$tw.sjcl` (the only read); `:1846-1866` the DOM store reader; `:2396-2401` `#:safe`.
* ''F6'' `story.js:40-58` hash write and `hashchange`; `:60-110` the five root handlers; `:25` `UpdateAddressBar`. `render.js:23-24,79-118` throttle, hooks, PostRender, globals. `rootwidget.js:21,31-57,81-109`. `windows.js:25-93`. `browser-messaging.js:42-54,100-121,158-196`. `modal.js:30-32,224,245`; `notifier.js:58`.
* ''F7'' WebKit ITP and Home Screen rules, Chrome/Firefox partitioning: §1 rows 5, 7, 8, 9. WebAuthn: rows 1-4, 23-24. Ed25519: row 6.
* ''F8'' The crossing fence: §1b rows 25-33.

